A sprawling workbench viewed from above in the style of Leonardo da Vinci's detailed technical sketches, featuring scattered mechanical components and modular building blocks of various sizes and shapes, some tiny like gears and springs, others large like clockwork assemblies. Golden-brown sepia tones on aged parchment texture, with fine crosshatching and anatomical-style precision. The components appear to interconnect like a Renaissance inventor's puzzle, some assembled into small functional devices, others waiting to be combined. Delicate ink lines show potential connection points between pieces. Scattered tools and measuring instruments frame the composition. Warm candlelight illuminates the scene, casting soft shadows that emphasize the three-dimensional quality of each modular element.
